      "writtenOn": "2020-07-29T20:01:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For now, I think we should keep things as they are and figure out a way to convert the STM PD phy to a driver at a later date. From the ServoV4.1 meeting today, all code needs to be merged by July 30 for EVT build.\n\nAlso, moving the sink state machine to common/usbc won\u0027t work because the TCPMv1 is used for the regular Servo Ports and TCPMv2 is used for the alternate power port. The code in common/usbc deems TCPMv1 and TCPMv2 as mutually exclusive.",
